		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Sinewy, azure wingless dragon with webbed forearms, gills, and dorsal fin.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 63, <strong>HP</strong> 39, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +6 (2d8) and 2 claws +6 (2d6) or 1 bile breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bile Breath</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) extending double near from linnorm. DEX 15+ or 3d8 damage and entangled for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Bileblood</strong>. Poison immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Death Curse</strong>. When slain, death curses the slayer. WIS 15+ or cannot hold breath underwater.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
